Name: Traefik
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Traefik API import source for Icinga Director
 Imports HTTP routers from one or more Traefik API endpoints (with optional
 HTTP Basic Auth) as Icinga Director import rows: the router's FQDN becomes
 the host name/address, and any Path/PathPrefix matchers become an
 http_urls array property.
